# The LittleJS engine builds in dist/ are vendored third-party artifacts, not
# project source. Marking them keeps a ~1.9MB engine bump out of diffs and out
# of code review, where it is pure noise: nobody should line-read a generated
# engine build, and a reviewer who tries will drown in it.
#
#   -diff              git prints "Binary files differ" instead of the contents
#   linguist-vendored  GitHub collapses it in PRs and drops it from language stats
dist/** -diff linguist-vendored

# Same reasoning for the generated single-file builds and their zips.
examples/*/build/** -diff linguist-generated
*.zip binary

# Vendored sprite atlas art
templates/atlas.png binary
*.png binary
